  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\n\"Excuse me?\" I asked. Was this little bee that i was deathly afraid of really whispering into my ear right now? \"Your orders, Your Majesty.\" Spoke the bee. Well, i guess i can be sure that i wasnt just hearing things. I was being spoken to by a Bee..... i think i have gone crazy. Or maybe I am dead, yea i must have died and this is what the afterlife is like. In this life bees can whisper into my ear, i guess i just have to accept it. Or maybe this is reality? I dont know. \"Hey bee, can you tell me what you are talking about?\". I asked. \"My name is greg first of all your majesty, and I just want to know what your orders are please.\" I could help but think of what a crazy name greg was for a bee. \"Well, I dont know what to tell you greg, i dont know what you are talking about.\"",
